title: "SustAInable: Neighborhood Heat Illness Risk Prediction"
abstract: "An XGBoost classifier that assigns US ZIP codes a probability of elevated heat illness ahead of an extreme heat event, so cities can deploy cooling resources before hospitalizations rise."
